        -:  164:// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
        -:  165:// wxWindowBase is the base class for all GUI controls/widgets, this is the public
        -:  166:// interface of this class.
        -:  167://
        -:  168:// Event handler: windows have themselves as their event handlers by default,
        -:  169:// but their event handlers could be set to another object entirely. This
        -:  170:// separation can reduce the amount of derivation required, and allow
        -:  171:// alteration of a window's functionality (e.g. by a resource editor that
        -:  172:// temporarily switches event handlers).
        -:  173:// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
        -:  174:
        -:  175:class WXDLLIMPEXP_CORE wxWindowBase : public wxEvtHandler
